# Cloudflare Pages headers. No indexing until phase 9 (AGENTS.md §4).
# Cloudflare adds X-Robots-Tag: noindex to previews by default; this line
# also covers production, which gets no default.
# No JavaScript outside the calculators (AGENTS.md §5); phase 5 gives the
# calculator pages their own policy (F5-05). scripts/site_check.py checks both.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  Content-Security-Policy: script-src 'none'
